        "en": "Build a synthwave neon-grid scene as a single self-contained index.html: an analytic perspective floor grid scrolling toward a banded retro sun under a hashed starfield, with a glowing horizon, at 60fps.",
        "zh-CN": "构建一个赛博朋克霓虹网格场景，作为单个自包含的 index.html：解析式透视地面网格向着带状复古落日滚动，头顶是哈希生成的星空，地平线泛着辉光，60fps 实时运行。"
